      "description": "Designed by a photographer, for photographers.\n\nBuilt for reliable, precise exposure measurement across film and digital workflows.\n\nmyLightMeter PRO gives you full control over exposure through a clean, professional set of tools.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Incident and reflected-light metering\n\n• Classic and Pro interface styles\n\n• Full manual control over aperture, shutter speed, ISO, and exposure compensation in 1/3- or 1/2-stop increments\n\n• Exposure range from 4 hours in Long Exposure mode to 1/8000 s, f/1.0 to f/512, and ISO 0.8 to 409,600\n\n• Aperture-priority (Av) and shutter-priority (Tv) modes\n\n• Automatic ISO adjustment or ISO lock\n\n• Reciprocity correction for long film exposures\n\n• Sensitivity down to −2.5 EV, ideal for low-light scenes\n\n• Average multiple readings\n\n• Import shutter speed, aperture, and ISO from photos in your library\n\n• Organize readings into Sessions with photos, exposure data, camera and lens details, and notes\n\n• Keep your Sessions synced through iCloud, so they remain available when you switch phones or use another device\n\n• Export Sessions as PDFs or print them\n\nAdvanced Tools\n\n• Hyperfocal-distance calculator\n\n• Five configurable presets, each storing camera, lens, ISO, filter, and film settings\n\n• EV display with an analog scale or numerical reading\n\n• mySPOTMETER and f/Tools integration\n\nAbout\n\nThis app is built and maintained by an independent photographer and developer. It is the tool I personally use and continuously refine.\n\nIf you have suggestions or need support, contact me at:\ndavidquiles@me.com",
